   "html": "<p>Hershey's gross margin was 33.5 percent in fiscal 2025.</p>\n<p>Down from 47.3 percent in FY2024 as cocoa costs peaked. Supports reading FY2025 as a commodity trough, not a change in the business.</p>\n<p>Check: Copied from the Milestone 1 memo. Not yet checked against the source; check it there, then set status to confirmed. If the source does not print this percentage directly, change tier to D and write the formula here.</p>\n<h3>Related</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2024%20gross%20margin%2047.3%20percent\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2024 gross margin 47.3 percent\">FY2024 gross margin 47.3 percent</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/Q1%202026%20adjusted%20gross%20margin%2040.4%20percent\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/Q1 2026 adjusted gross margin 40.4 percent\">Q1 2026 adjusted gross margin 40.4 percent</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=01%20Sources/S1%20Hershey%20Form%2010-K%20FY2025\" data-note=\"01 Sources/S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025\">S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025</a></li>\n</ul>",
