   "html": "<p>Hershey's net income was $883 million in fiscal 2025.</p>\n<p>Less than half of FY2024. A reader looking only at this year might call Hershey a declining company; the memo reads it as a trough inside a mature stage. It also makes a trailing P/E look expensive.</p>\n<p>Check: Copied from the Milestone 1 memo. Not yet checked against the source; check it there, then set status to confirmed.</p>\n<h3>Related</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2024%20net%20income%202.22%20billion%20dollars\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2024 net income 2.22 billion dollars\">FY2024 net income 2.22 billion dollars</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=01%20Sources/S1%20Hershey%20Form%2010-K%20FY2025\" data-note=\"01 Sources/S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025\">S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025</a></li>\n</ul>",
