   "html": "<p>Hershey's net sales grew 4.4 percent in fiscal 2025, to $11.69 billion.</p>\n<p>Shown on the site as a Thesis fact. Low, price-led growth is the first of four indicators that Hershey is mature. If growth were much higher, the stage call would need revisiting.</p>\n<p>Check: Copied from the Milestone 1 memo. Not yet checked against the source; check it there, then set status to confirmed. If the source does not print this percentage directly, change tier to D and write the formula here.</p>\n<h3>Related</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2025%20net%20sales%2011.69%20billion%20dollars\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2025 net sales 11.69 billion dollars\">FY2025 net sales 11.69 billion dollars</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2024%20net%20sales%20growth%200.3%20percent\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2024 net sales growth 0.3 percent\">FY2024 net sales growth 0.3 percent</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=01%20Sources/S1%20Hershey%20Form%2010-K%20FY2025\" data-note=\"01 Sources/S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025\">S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025</a></li>\n</ul>",
